1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:03,330
(Sheldon:)the severing of which would
cause me any discomfort.

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:06,000
(Sheldon:)The relationship simply
outlived its utility,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,970
(Sheldon:)and I'm continuing on
with my life as before.

4
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,850
(Penny:)Okay. Good.

5
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:14,690
(Sheldon:)Now, if you'll excuse me,
I'm off to buy a pussycat.

6
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,560
(Leonard:)I gotta tell you guys,

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,140
(Leonard:)I'm a little worried about Sheldon.

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,980
(Howard:)We're all a little
worried about Sheldon.

9
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,020
(Leonard:)No, I mean since the
Shamy hit a reef.

10
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,280
(Howard:)Oh, I thought you were just
making a generalization:

11
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,700
"You know,
I'm worried about Sheldon

12
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,900
"someday setting off a
low-yield nuclear device

13
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:34,660
(Howard:)because the cafeteria
ran out of lime Jell-O."

14
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,040
What does "hit a reef" mean?

15
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,580
(Leonard:)Uh, went splitsville.

16
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,580
(Raj:)Pardon?

17
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:42,170
(Leonard:)Turned to boom-boom.

18
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:43,920
(Sheldon:)Ah.

19
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:46,390
(Leonard:)I think Sheldon really misses Amy.

20
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:50,660
You should lend him your copy of
Bombay Badonkadonks.

21
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,840
(Leonard:)He got a cat to keep him company.

22
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:53,840
(Raj:)You're kidding.

23
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,090
He takes it everywhere:

24
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:56,950
(Leonard:)to bed, to the bathroom.

25
00:00:56,950 --> 00:00:58,900
(Raj:)He takes the kitty to the potty?

26
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,520
(Howard:)I thought we discussed the P-word.

